    "decision": "stay",
    "reason": "I can keep my staff and give Leo his raise only if the shop stays mine.",
    "diaries": {
      "dana": "Today a chain offered to buy the shop, and I carried it alone through the rush. I told Leo first and promised to protect him. Sam pushed me to sell, which made me wonder who she really is. I am staying.",
      "leo": "Dana told me about the buyout in the back room this morning. A regular kept asking questions, so I kept my mouth shut. Dana promised me a raise if she stays, and tonight she said she is staying.",
